nt stages, during the greatest Slavic festivals. Time and hearths are intertwined. Your actions affect the world around you — make changes and carefully observe the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/extras/d4198a146670c991741f2e9087ad9ac8.avif?t=1787571201\" width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/extras/07b7a1f1df5a4a11dad0a4399f8354ec.avif?t=1787571201\" width=1560 height=647 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3. INVESTIGATE – Explore a mysterious village, born from the real world and museum treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of museum artifacts and entire buildings, brought into the game from the real world through photogrammetry, open before you a land where every detail matters. Freely roam the ancient village and its one-of-a-kind surroundings. As you explore this open world, conduct a supernatural investigation rooted in Slavic mythology — more authentic and immersive than ever before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/extras/0642dfed15c51f88bc967ba59ff1f8fd.avif?t=1787571201\" width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/extras/8dc6d41d5558a65b13a888aead07e88f.avif?t=1787571201\" width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/extras/67fb6a499cb9cb2076a97c48321726ae.avif?t=1787571201\" width=1560 height=646 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You are the Ashter – a Slavic fire mage and tracker of mythical beings. Following a legendary creature, you reach a village caught in a time rift. Embark on a magical investigation – travel through time, explore the ancient land, and bond with fire to shape villagers’ fate and uncover the mystery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, French, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Ukrainian, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This is a beautiful game that takes you on a rich magical journey to discover what’s really important, and does it so well it’s sure to warm even the hardest of hearts.”<br>93/100 – Adventure Game Hotspot<br><br>“The End of the Sun is much more than just a narrative adventure: it's an experience that invites you to reflect on time, traditions, and the stories that shape our lives. [...] A title that has been in development for many years, but after this long wait, it manages to be highly appreciated for the depth of the stories woven into the narrative and its rather stunning technical and graphical quality, very close to another similar work: What Remains of Edith Finch.”<br>8/10 – Game Score<br><br>“Get ready for truly witcher-like encounters and investigations involving mythological creatures such as drowners or nightwraiths, the rituals of Forefathers’ Eve, Kupala Night, and even mushroom trips in the company of the kind-hearted Slavic god Svarog.”<br>CD-Action<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/0e315c29528dd805bc050d8b91332f6bb4a7d2ac/header_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787571201", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/912840/92810d2518792315f61068fc30058d0d2822eae8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787571201", "capsule_imagev5": "https